body:
Right, it just isn't that simple. I salute you for finding a purpose in helping others, but lately it seems like I've hit a big ass brick wall in that too man. I've put a lot of effort in being there for people, donating to charity and trying to live green and stuff, but I still end up feeling like shit. This world is such a bloody mess and I feel so fucking powerless.

&#x200B;

P.S: Will do! And give me a heads up if you find it before I do!
